# Build context for Dockerfile.poc (BuildKit reads <dockerfile>.dockerignore
# in preference to .dockerignore).
#
# Differs from .dockerignore in one line that matters: `assets/` is NOT
# excluded. The hosted demo image never runs an engine, so it does not need
# the packaged pipeline configs; the fenced image spawns the engine as a child
# process and dev-cli resolves `assets/tenx-mcp-file.config.yaml` relative to
# the package root. Without it the engine starts and dies on "no app config
# specified", three layers away from the missing file.
.git
node_modules
build
test-build
eval
docs
scripts
.github
*.md
*.log
poc
